get emails

for any where sender is seek or Linkedin, AND subject contains Job Alert

open the email

generate UID from subject, datetime sent/recieved

save each of the links into array

send to queue





queue program will then take in requests from API, format it as a map/json, save the email into json file in minio bucket, with:

email UID

status: (waiting, pending, complete)

each of the links

then will return a 200 to the producer



the consumer will then pull items off

anything that has been pulled will show as pending, for up to a certain amount of time. in this time its hidden from other consumer workers

it will then open up each link, get job title, employer, location, salary guide, description

run this thru LLM to get scores and a brief blurb of how applicable it is for me

and save all this data into a different directory in that same bucket

once complete, the consumer will tell the queue it is completed



the email client program will then check for any emails in the queue that have been marked as complete, at which point it will mark it as read (just for now, once i can trust it then it can just delete the email instead)





and then basic webapp to view the list of jobs

sort by ratings, newest, etc

ability to quickly read, then click link to apply
